  "schema": "laya-controller-transaction-host-input-v1",
  "scope": "normalized fixed-size sequencer/adapter schema for exactly one COMPUTE, PROVENANCE, or PRODUCER transaction; explicit little-endian fields and zero reserves, independent Python byte oracle, host stream adapter ownership of the six external FIFOs (18 signals), partial response continuation under cancel, pre-admission cancel rejection, cleanup END admission, stale binding reporting, malformed-frame raw capture inside the adapter followed by normalized rejection with all completion trust fields cleared, sequencer-only codec closure without the three external protocol codec objects, and one in-flight software state machine; no HLS RTL generation, actual depth2 backpressure, graph sequencer integration, physical AXI/fence, full-model request, resource, timing, or board claim",
